  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ほうじょうのおう　でんせつについて\nピオニーが　まとめた　メモ。\nふるい　しゃしんが　はりつけられている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "풍요의 왕 전설에 대해\n피오니가 정리한 메모.\n오래된 사진이 붙어 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "皮歐尼針對豐饒之王傳說\n所整理的筆記。\n上面貼著很舊的照片。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Les notes de Dhilan sur le légendaire Seigneur\ndes récoltes. Elles sont accompagnées d’une vieille\nphotographie.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gesammelte Notizen von Peony über die Legende des\nKönigs der reichen Ernte. Ein altes Foto ist auch dabei.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una nota escrita por Peony acerca de la leyenda del\nRey de las Cosechas. Lleva adjunta una vieja fotografía.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Appunti presi da Peony sulla leggenda del Re\ndell’abbondanza. C’è attaccata una vecchia foto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A clue about the King of Bountiful Harvests. It’s written\nby Peony, and an old photo is attached to it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "豊穣の王　伝説について\nピオニーが　まとめた　メモ。\n古い　写真が　貼り付けられている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "皮欧尼整理的\n有关丰饶之王传说的笔记。\n上面贴着很旧的照片。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una nota escrita por Peony acerca de la leyenda del\nRey de las Cosechas. Lleva adjunta una vieja fotografía.",
      "version_group": {
